<p>{{companyName}} is now an active PlanetTalk Business Partner, and your partner code is ready to share with your customers.</p>

<p>To help you get going, we've added <strong>${{welcomeCredit}}</strong> to your partner wallet as a welcome credit towards your first payout. You can request a payout once your balance reaches <strong>${{minimumPayout}}</strong>.</p>

