<p>Prefer a code that reflects your business name? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #24B6C3;">{{supportEmail}}</a> and we can arrange one for you.</p>

<h3>Here's how you earn</h3>
<p>For every customer who signs up with your code and makes their first top-up, you'll earn:</p>
<ul>
