  <li><strong>{{commissionRate}}% commission</strong> on every top-up they make for up to two years, including their first top-up</li>
</ul>

<p>Your customers also get a reason to join: a <strong>100% bonus on their first top-up</strong> when they use your partner code.</p>

<h3>Your first target: 6 paying customers</h3>
<p>Six new customers will earn you ${{firstTargetReward}} in referral rewards. Add your ${{welcomeCredit}} welcome credit, and your wallet reaches <strong>${{firstTargetTotal}}</strong>, before any top-up commissions are counted.</p>

<h3>Start sharing today</h3>
